From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:32:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(led.c): doxygen comments

Hand port of 36e931f1 onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- led_extcut(): re-adds the tree-sitter extension.
- led_info is now _led_info(buf, pn) with led_info()/led_infoc() wrappers (tab_complete); comment moved and pn documented.
- led_redraw(): redraws the tree-sitter preview instead when one is active.
- led_line(): LED_AGENT flag and its ^o/^l return; :et and :tc key behaviour.
- led_input(): new source_beg/source_end parameters.
- 'int' wording in ext_attmerge()/file_index() is now s64.
Beyond the audit (reread of patched @briefs): led_printparts() notes the :lw wrapping, led_prompt() mentions LED_AGENT, led_done() also frees the path-completion buffer.
dstrlen() moved to vi.h upstream; its comment goes with vi.h. Comments only; stripped binary identical.
